icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Export staging evidence as a portable archive](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14956#discussion_r4486946887) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nThis PR connects issue triage to ghmock so reported bugs can be checked with real GitHub CLI builds against a fake API, with command evidence retained for maintainers.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds setup for ghmock, GitHub schemas, reported releases, the latest release, and a source build.\n- Adds reproduction instructions, build comparisons, artifact uploads, and a longer execution timeout.\n- Refreshes agentic-workflow guidance for diagnosis, debugging, and work queues.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `.github/​workflows/​issue-triage.md` | Configures reproduction tools and instructs triage to compare builds and retain evidence. |\r\n| `.github/​workflows/​issue-triage.lock.yml` | Regenerates workflow execution, setup, model selection, and artifact handling. |\r\n| `.github/​skills/​agentic-workflows/​SKILL.md` | Updates routing to debugging and work-queue guidance. |\r\n| `.github/​scripts/​issue-triage-ghmock.sh` | Prepares ghmock, schemas, and CLI builds with setup warnings. |\r\n| `.github/​agents/​agentic-workflows.md` | Refreshes workflow diagnosis and controlled execution guidance. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","bodyHTML":"\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">🟡 Changes recommended</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Failures in reproduction prerequisites can skip the triage agent entirely instead of allowing ordinary triage to continue without reproduction.</p>\n<details open=\"\">\n<summary><strong>4 open issues</strong></summary>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture><source 